        "x1": 0.6747037600847631,
        "y1": 0.3393939239810212
      },
      "text": "from consumers is accurate and secure from unauthorized use.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2558823629142412,
        "y0": 0.35090909702609285,
        "x1": 0.7359150905235141,
        "y1": 0.3634848546500158
      },
      "text": "Table 1. Privacy Concerns and Fair Information Practices Principles",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2558823629142412,
        "y0": 0.35090909702609285,
        "x1": 0.7359150905235141,
        "y1": 0.3634848546500158
      },
      "text": "Table 1. Privacy Concerns and Fair Information Practices Principles",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.3866666820314195,
        "x1": 0.9197980095358456,
        "y1": 0.39924243965534245
      },
      "text": "Based on this overlap, we thus define privacy policy statement adequacy as a second order construct, comprising of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.40106065225119547,
        "x1": 0.9176332561019199,
        "y1": 0.4136364098751184
      },
      "text": "perception of the Web users that the website (via privacy policy statement) is demonstrating adequate measures to handle",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.4156061314573192,
        "x1": 0.916461221532884,
        "y1": 0.4281818890812421
      },
      "text": "their information privacy concerns related to collection, unauthorized secondary use, errors, and unauthorized access.  Based",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.4301516106634429,
        "x1": 0.8033369974373212,
        "y1": 0.4427273682873658
      },
      "text": "on the ELM, individuals with high PC should be influenced by the adequacy of the privacy policy statement.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.4598486435533774,
        "x1": 0.9160711749706393,
        "y1": 0.47242440117730033
      },
      "text": "Hypothesis 2. For individuals with high privacy concern (and not for those with low privacy concern), perceived adequacy of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.4743941612917968,
        "x1": 0.5366633296792024,
        "y1": 0.4869699189157197
      },
      "text": "the privacy policy statement is associated with trust in the website.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.5042424057469224,
        "x1": 0.20863235074710224,
        "y1": 0.5156060421105587
      },
      "text": "Peripheral Cues",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.5322727133529355,
        "x1": 0.3489529478783701,
        "y1": 0.5448484709768584
      },
      "text": "Perceived Website Information Quality.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.35352948755999797,
        "y0": 0.5322727133529355,
        "x1": 0.9158790937436172,
        "y1": 0.5448484709768584
      },
      "text": "The study by Nicolaou et al. (2006 p.335) demonstrated that users’ “cognitive beliefs",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0882352691849852,
        "y0": 0.5468182310913549,
        "x1": 0.9168518415463516,
        "y1": 0.5593939887152778
      },
      "text": "about the favorable or unfavorable characteristics of the currency, accuracy, completeness, relevance, and reliability” of the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0882352691849852,
        "y0": 0.5612122013111307,
        "x1": 0.9164611966002221,
        "y1": 0.5737879589350536
      },
      "text": "information during an exchange session can help build trusting beliefs. Since low PC individuals look for cues to deduce the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0882352691849852,
        "y0": 0.5757576805172544,
        "x1": 0.916656868130553,
        "y1": 0.5883334381411773
      },
      "text": "quality of a website’s privacy-policy statement, they are more likely to rely on the contents of websites for which they have",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0882352691849852,
        "y0": 0.5903031597233782,
        "x1": 0.8823495254017948,
        "y1": 0.6028789173473011
      },
      "text": "to expend cognitive energy anyways.  Hence, information quality is a strong cue for judging a website’s privacy policy.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0882352691849852,
        "y0": 0.6124244350375552,
        "x1": 0.9164619944454019,
        "y1": 0.6250001926614781
      },
      "text": "Hypothesis 3. For individuals with low privacy concern, perceived website information quality is associated with trust in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0882352691849852,
        "y0": 0.6269699527759744,
        "x1": 0.14625389747370302,
        "y1": 0.6395457103998974
      },
      "text": "website.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0882352691849852,
        "y0": 0.6490912280901514,
        "x1": 0.16732938928541793,
        "y1": 0.6616669857140743
      },
      "text": "Other Cues.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16745094847834968,
        "y0": 0.6490912280901514,
        "x1": 0.9162735284543505,
        "y1": 0.6616669857140743
      },
      "text": "Trust seals like BBBOnline™ and TRUSTe™ increase consumer perceptions of a site’s trustworthiness through",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.6634851983099272,
        "x1": 0.9192123101427664,
        "y1": 0.6760609559338502
      },
      "text": "transference. Research (Consumers International 2002) has found that website presentation quality (design quality) and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.6780306967821987,
        "x1": 0.9162665660085242,
        "y1": 0.6906064544061218
      },
      "text": "availability of the contact details of the physical entity behind the website are associated with trust in the website. Web users",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.6925761952544703,
        "x1": 0.9158750234865675,
        "y1": 0.7051519528783934
      },
      "text": "rely on design quality of the website to ascertain the degree of trust they can assign to the website. High design quality lowers",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.7071216937267419,
        "x1": 0.9170470580556034,
        "y1": 0.7196974513506649
      },
      "text": "risk beliefs associated with the website, and hence enhance the degree of trust. Users who lack the necessary motivation to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.7216671921990134,
        "x1": 0.9203828487520903,
        "y1": 0.7342429498229364
      },
      "text": "delve deeper use such cues to quickly make an impression about the trustworthiness of the site. This is in line with the ELM.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.7360611624187894,
        "x1": 0.9199930016511406,
        "y1": 0.7486369200427123
      },
      "text": "The individuals with low PC are in a low elaboration state and rely on these peripheral cues for trust formation or",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.7506066608910609,
        "x1": 0.1823995752272263,
        "y1": 0.7631824185149838
      },
      "text": "enhancement.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.7803036745148476,
        "x1": 0.8727483001409793,
        "y1": 0.7928794321387705
      },
      "text": "Hypothesis 4. For the low PC individuals, perceived presence of third party endorsements is associated with trust in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.7948491729871191,
        "x1": 0.14625389747370302,
        "y1": 0.807424930611042
      },
      "text": "website.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.8245461866109058,
        "x1": 0.9094148710662243,
        "y1": 0.8371219442348288
      },
      "text": "Hypothesis 5. For the low PC individuals, perceived presence of company information is associated with trust in the website.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823526295181973,
        "y0": 0.8542432098677664,
        "x1": 0.8354959113925111,
        "y1": 0.8668189674916893
      },
      "text": "Hypothesis 6. For the low PC individuals, perceived website design quality is associated with trust in the website.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08823529411764706,
        "y0": 0.9404541169754183,
        "x1": 0.7403969858206955,
        "y1": 0.9518177533390546
      },
      "text": "Proceedings of the Fourteenth Americas Conference on Information Systems, Toronto, ON, Canada August 14",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
